<Solution>
  <!-- WikipediaPublisher.WithAndroid.slnx
       The Android solution: everything in WikipediaPublisher.slnx PLUS the Android head and the
       .Android twins of its library projects, which need the .NET Android workload.
       Open WikipediaPublisher.slnx instead if you only have the plain .NET SDK. -->
